ved the exact opposite of it's stated goals. It's a utter failure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T21:17:43-08:00","id":1035611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1031175-the-women-s-march-on-washington?p=1035589#post1035589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tell me how fucking over Bernie Sanders and the Toronto Pride Parade reduces the amount of unarmed black men killed by police?<br /> <br /> Explain how all the other acts of embarrassing behavior BLM gets up to has achieved anything in that regard. You can because the only thing BLM has successfully achieved is to clear the path for President Donald Trump.<br /> <br /> BLM has achieved the exact opposite of it's stated goals. It's a utter failure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except, and here's the big thing, *ANY* &quot;movement&quot; that has no leader, no organization or structure beyond &quot;do something and say it's for X&quot; is going to have problems, and if you get idiots involved, doing things in the name of the group there is no one that can go &quot;No, they're not part of our organization, this is clearly a frame&quot;. <br /> <br /> The Tea Party movement was started on people who wanted sensible tax reforms, and ended up being a collection of people that wanted to eliminate the government for comparison.<br /> <br /> Occupy Wall Street started a collective protest about accountability and without membership/organization devolved into &quot;look at the people who demand we eliminate pronouns&quot;<br /> <br /> MRA started out as people that were actually concerned about the rights of fathers and the unbalanced legal actions around divorce, and now it's practically a curse word.<br /> <br /> BLM started (and still is primarily composed of) people that want accountability for police. Idiots did what idiots did. Hell, we've had people torturing others in the name of BLM. This doesn't negate the concerns that spawned the BLM movement any more than the MRA negates parental rights, OWS negates the lack of accountability or the Tea party negates concerns about taxation.<br /> <br /> Of course the stupid actions don't help the cause of the BLM movement. They do not however, negate the original point or purpose of the BLM movement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T21:42:23-08:00","id":1035620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1031175-the-women-s-march-on-washington?p=1035589#post1035589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tell me how fucking over Bernie Sanders and the Toronto Pride Parade reduces the amount of unarmed black men killed by police?<br /> <br /> Explain how all the other acts of embarrassing behavior BLM gets up to has achieved anything in that regard. You can because the only thing BLM has successfully achieved is to clear the path for President Donald Trump.<br /> <br /> BLM has achieved the exact opposite of it's stated goals. It's a utter failure.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're trying to expose the fact that black people are targeted unfairly by police, that lethal force is used against them unnecessarily, and that when innocent black people are killed by police, it's covered up or otherwise ignored.<br /> <br /> Because telling everyone it happens over the past several decades hasn't done anything.<br /> <br /> As for a failure, it successfully gained the attention of white America and spurred various investigations into the law enforcement of various cities, notably Chicago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T22:41:56-08:00","id":1035632,"title":"","content":"Hopefully joining the women's march in Seattle tomorrow. Ignored most of the coverage today, sickening stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://