 negates the lack of accountability or the Tea party negates concerns about taxation.<br /> <br /> Of course the stupid actions don't help the cause of the BLM movement. They do not however, negate the original point or purpose of the BLM movement.</div> </div> </div> </div> I see no connection between occupy wall street and pronouns. <br /> <br /> The Tea Party has offered nothing of value since day one. <br /> <br /> I agree that the concerns first discussed by BLM are valid, I just think BLM is the wrong vechile, the idiots have to much influence and the MRM is a much better vechile to address the issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T10:19:21-08:00","id":1035740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1031175-the-women-s-march-on-washington?p=1035681#post1035681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree that the concerns first discussed by BLM are valid,</div> </div> </div> </div>Except you haven't mentioned anything that would fix them and you keep calling them idiots. Despite the chance to use non lethal tools, against black men police are more likely to use guns. And body cams don't matter when police are entirely in charge of who sees it, if it's seen at all.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I just think BLM is the wrong vechile, the idiots have to much influence and the MRM is a much better vechile to address the issue. </div> </div> </div>And the MRM doesn't care. That's the whole point. If people cared about black people being targeted by police, they would have done something about it a long time ago. This is why they're trying to get notice. Because despite body cams, it's smartphones that have been capturing the evidence. Despite people trying to ignore it, they're going to keep showing it to you because it's important. And people who might not live in the next few years because a cop can kill them without any chance of prosecution might not care who's president.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T12:43:36-08:00","id":1035797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1031175-the-women-s-march-on-washington?p=1035740#post1035740\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except you haven't mentioned anything that would fix them and you keep calling them idiots. Despite the chance to use non lethal tools, against black men police are more likely to use guns. And body cams don't matter when police are entirely in charge of who sees it, if it's seen at all.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> And the MRM doesn't care. That's the whole point. If people cared about black people being targeted by police, they would have done something about it a long time ago. This is why they're trying to get notice. Because despite body cams, it's smartphones that have been capturing the evidence. Despite people trying to ignore it, they're going to keep showing it to you because it's important. And people who might not live in the next few years because a cop can kill them without any chance of prosecution might not care who's president.</div> </div> </div> </div> Without a chance of prosecution is over stating it, yes cops sometimes get way with this, but legally they can be charged and convicted. <br /> <br /> And the MRM doesn't have the power yet to fix, but the MRM is slowly growing in influence.<br /> <br /> Look I wish the more sane elements of BLM luck, but I simply have no faith in BLM based on it's actions.<br /> <br /> And I doubt the Women's March will achieve anything, again skeptical. I hope they succeed in protecting abortion rights, but the President will likely do what he wants on the issue. <br /> <br /> I hear he's cutting grants to fight violence against women which I don't support and feel is wrong (I want the system reformed to be fairer and more accessible to men and trans, not to blow the whole system fucking up or for abused women to come to harm just so Trump can save a buck).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"